","text":"Free cash flow was $875 million in FY2026: operating cash flow of $884 million less capital spending of $9 million (computed from two filed figures). That is 30% of revenue. In FY2021 it was $115 million.","cites":["OKTA.ocf.2026","OKTA.capex.2026","OKTA.revenue.2026","OKTA.ocf.2021","OKTA.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $544 million in FY2026, 18.6% of revenue, against 23.5% in FY2021.","cites":["OKTA.sbc.2026","OKTA.revenue.2026","OKTA.sbc.2021","OKTA.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $73 million to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["OKTA.buybacks.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-07-31 revenue was $805 million, up 10.6% from $728 million in the three months ended 2025-07-31.","cites":["OKTA.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","OKTA.d.revenue.2025-05-01.2025-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-07-31 revenue added up to $3.1 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $232 million and net income to $296 million.","cites":["OKTA.d.revenue.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.revenue.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","OKTA.d.revenue.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","OKTA.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","OKTA.d.opinc.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.opinc.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","OKTA.d.opinc.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","OKTA.d.opinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","OKTA.d.netinc.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.netinc.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","OKTA.d.netinc.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","OKTA.d.netinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $979 million: operating cash flow of $987 million less capital spending of $8 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["OKTA.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2025-07-31","OKTA.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","OKTA.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","OKTA.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-07-31","OKTA.d.capex.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.capex.2025-02-01.2025-07-31","OKTA.d.capex.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","OKTA.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","OKTA.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $4.8 billion at the end of FY2026, against $4.2 billion a year earlier. That is 165.4% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["OKTA.rpo.2026","OKTA.rpo.2025","OKTA.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.9 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $1.7 billion a year earlier.","cites":["OKTA.deferred.2026","OKTA.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 6,366 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $459,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["OKTA.q.employees","OKTA.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $4 million, after $11 million in FY2025.","cites":["OKTA.restructuring.2026","OKTA.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $858 million in cash and cash equivalents, and $350 million of debt as tagged (ConvertibleDebtNoncurrent + ConvertibleDebtCurrent). Cash exceeded that debt by $508 million (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["OKTA.cash.2026","OKTA.debtLong.2026","OKTA.debtCurrent.2026"]}]},"fin":{"OKTA":{}},"quotes":{"OKTA.q.employees":{"c":"OKTA","kind":"employees","n":6366,"quote":"As of January 31, 2026, we had 6,366 employees, of which approximately 56% were in the United States and 44% were in our international locations.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-26-000020","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-03-05","proof":"54c2b4680e2996e441a341c984e84c180c85e727aaa06bc1701ffbfdbb25cfe0"}}}